  "description": "Fully managed PDF library for .NET, written from ISO 32000-2: an object model, a reader that recovers broken files (cross-reference tables and streams, object streams, incremental updates), the standard filters (CCITT and JBIG2 included), full and incremental writers, a document API (pages, content builder, standard 14 fonts and embedded font subsets, shadings, patterns, forms and transparency, images, metadata, outlines, links, text extraction), a renderer of the pages to images, and PAdES digital signatures and their verification.",
